T*
(   - Accept service of all legal notices, show-cause notices, and official communications ) Tj
T*
(     from BIS on our behalf in India) Tj
T*
(   - Respond to BIS queries, compliance notices, and enforcement actions) Tj
T*
(   - Represent us in all proceedings before BIS authorities) Tj
T*
() Tj
